WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.300 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:62.00%
What is an Apple Account?

00:03.300 --> 00:05.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:67.00%
Your Apple Account
is the account that you use

00:05.500 --> 00:09.633 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:52.00%
to unlock your entire
Apple universe.

00:09.633 --> 00:11.300 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:45.00%
You can access
your Apple Account

00:11.300 --> 00:14.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:80.00%
across all of your Apple devices
when you sign in

00:14.500 --> 00:16.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:57.00%
with your email address
or phone number.

00:16.500 --> 00:19.400 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:77.00%
♪ Cheerful instrumental music ♪

00:19.400 --> 00:23.100 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:60.00%
So your information
is wherever you need it,

00:23.100 --> 00:25.933 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:52.00%
whenever you need it.

00:25.933 --> 00:28.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:45.00%
So why do you need
an Apple Account?

00:28.500 --> 00:30.200 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:65.00%
On all your Apple devices,

00:30.200 --> 00:32.100 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:52.00%
you can sign in
to your Apple Account

00:32.100 --> 00:36.700 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:72.00%
to store and access
your personal data in iCloud,

00:36.700 --> 00:39.233 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:62.00%
like your saved passwords
in the Passwords app,

00:39.233 --> 00:40.933 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:75.00%
your photos in the Photos app,

00:40.933 --> 00:43.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:47.00%
and your activity
in the Fitness app.

00:43.500 --> 00:46.700 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:77.00%
You can send unlimited messages
to other Apple users

00:46.700 --> 00:48.233 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:35.00%
using iMessage

00:48.233 --> 00:50.800 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:75.00%
and use FaceTime
for video calls with everyone,

00:50.800 --> 00:53.300 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:60.00%
including Android users.

00:53.300 --> 00:55.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:52.00%
Your Apple Account
also lets you sign in

00:55.500 --> 01:00.033 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:77.00%
to compatible apps and websites
using Sign in with Apple.

01:00.033 --> 01:02.800 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:77.00%
You can purchase apps and games
in the App Store,

01:02.800 --> 01:06.400 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:75.00%
books in Apple Books,
and music in the iTunes Store.

01:06.400 --> 01:10.100 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:80.00%
You can also stream Apple Music,
watch Apple TV+,

01:10.100 --> 01:13.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:75.00%
play Apple Arcade games,
and if you ever lose a device,

01:13.500 --> 01:15.900 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:77.00%
Find My can help you locate it.

01:15.900 --> 01:20.000 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:70.00%
It's all your Apple services
under one account.

01:20.000 --> 01:23.000 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:72.00%
But what if you want to share
your purchases and services

01:23.000 --> 01:25.000 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:77.00%
with the people you care about?

01:25.000 --> 01:26.433 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:27.00%
No problem.

01:26.433 --> 01:27.833 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:62.00%
Thanks to Family Sharing,

01:27.833 --> 01:30.833 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:57.00%
everyone can have their own
Apple Account and share

01:30.833 --> 01:34.333 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:82.00%
eligible subscriptions,
purchases, and more.

01:34.333 --> 01:38.100 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:75.00%
Your Family Sharing group
can even share iCloud+ storage

01:38.100 --> 01:42.533 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:77.00%
and features like Hide My Email
and iCloud Private Relay.

01:42.533 --> 01:45.400 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:60.00%
And when you use Find My
with Family Sharing,

01:45.400 --> 01:48.100 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:60.00%
if someone in your group
loses their device,

01:48.100 --> 01:51.400 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:70.00%
you can help them locate it,
even if it's offline.

01:51.400 --> 01:53.500 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:70.00%
Since everyone
in your Family Sharing group

01:53.500 --> 01:55.333 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:70.00%
has their own Apple Account,

01:55.333 --> 01:57.000 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:55.00%
you can share
what you want to share

01:57.000 --> 02:00.533 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:80.00%
while still keeping
your account secure and private.

02:00.533 --> 02:03.133 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:50.00%
Your Apple Account
is really important,

02:03.133 --> 02:06.833 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:62.00%
so keeping it secure
is really important, too.

02:06.833 --> 02:07.800 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:17.00%
[CLICK]

02:07.800 --> 02:09.900 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:55.00%
Use a strong password,

02:09.900 --> 02:12.133 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:72.00%
don't reuse it anywhere else,

02:12.133 --> 02:14.500 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:77.00%
and don't share it with anyone.

02:14.500 --> 02:16.400 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:77.00%
With two-factor authentication,

02:16.400 --> 02:19.800 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:72.00%
your information is encrypted
and your data is secure,

02:19.800 --> 02:23.033 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:50.00%
and no one else
can sign in but you.

02:23.033 --> 02:25.300 align:center position:80.00% line:9.97% size:2.00%
♪

02:25.300 --> 02:28.033 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:62.00%
And that's Apple Account.

02:28.033 --> 02:30.800 align:center position:50.00% line:84.70% size:57.00%
One user, one password,

02:30.800 --> 02:33.600 align:center position:50.00% line:79.37% size:60.00%
one account
for your Apple universe.
